title: EMR Connect › Page › Arrive and read the page
route: /emr
intro: What a person sees on arrival: two header buttons, four tiles, the Connected systems list, Recent activity and two side panels. Each region hands off to its own diagram.
dir: TD
also: Demo data. Three systems start on the list: two clinical record sites (Connected) and a Billing system (Needs a quick look).
---
start s1 "Click 'EMR Connect' in the sidebar\nUnder Connections"
screen p1 "EMR Connect\nCharts arrive on their own. Nothing is written back until a person approves it."

group gHead "Header buttons"
  click hb1 "Click 'Manage mapping'"
  decision hq "Any system on the list?"
  overlay ho "Manage drawer opens\nfor the outpatient site, or the first system"
  endx hx "Button is dimmed\nNothing to open"
  click hb2 "Click 'Connect a system'"
endgroup
goto hg1 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Manage › Open the Manage drawer"
goto hg2 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Connect a system › Choose the system and contact"

group gTiles "Four tiles (they are not buttons)"
  process t1 "Last sync\nTime since the newest sync. Green, amber or red"
  process t2 "Charts matched today\n23 'to open cases'"
  process t3 "Files pulled\n142 'this week'"
  process t4 "Need a mapping\n2 'fields the agents could not place'"
endgroup
goto tg "Continues in: EMR Connect › Page › What each tile shows"

group gSys "Connected systems"
  screen c1 "Connected systems\nRead access for charts, insurance details and medications"
  process c2 "One row per system: name, what it holds, last sync, status pill, buttons"
  click c3 "Click 'Sync now' in the card header"
  click c4 "Click 'Sync now', 'Fix', 'Reconnect' or 'Manage' on a row"
  toast c5 "'Connect your record system to let charts arrive on their own.'\nEmpty list. Not reachable in the demo: a system can be disconnected, never removed"
endgroup
goto cg1 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Sync › Sync now"
goto cg2 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Connected systems › What each status means"

group gAct "Recent activity"
  screen a1 "Recent activity\nEvery read and write is logged. Newest six lines"
  click a2 "Click 'See all 8'\nOnly shown when there are more than six lines"
endgroup
goto ag "Continues in: EMR Connect › Recent activity › Read the activity log"

group gSide "Right-hand panels"
  screen r1 "What the agents can do here\nRead: assessments, notes, labs, medications, insurance card"
  process r2 "Write back: only the approval number and dates, and only after a person approves"
  screen r3 "Needs a mapping\nPill with the count, then one row per field with a 'Map' button"
  click r4 "Click 'Map' on a row"
endgroup
goto rg "Continues in: EMR Connect › Needs a mapping › Map a field"

s1 --> p1
p1 --> hb1 & hb2
hb1 --> hq
hq -->|Yes| ho
hq -->|No| hx
ho --> hg1
hb2 --> hg2
p1 --> t1 & t2 & t3 & t4
t1 --> tg
t2 --> tg
t3 --> tg
t4 --> tg
p1 --> c1
c1 --> c2
c2 --> c3 & c4
c1 -.-> c5
c3 --> cg1
c4 --> cg2
p1 --> a1
a1 --> a2 --> ag
p1 --> r1
r1 --> r2
p1 --> r3
r3 --> r4 --> rg
